        "f_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our Branzino comes from Esteros Lubimar in Cádiz, Spain, in skin-on 6 oz portions.</p><p>Our Branzino tested at 460 mg EPA and 900 mg DHA, about 1,360 mg of marine omega-3s, plus 27 mcg selenium, per 6 oz skin-on portion. Values vary by sample and season.</p><p>Low mercury, tested to a tenth of the FDA action level. Every supplier is third-party tested for nutrition, mercury and microplastics, then randomly audited to ensure consistent compliance with the Seatopia Standard. Farms named, panels published.</p>",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
